    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ramoorsiinda fuga Diro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweaydeaba damanagi bea eaweeda madeeda bea sheeda, hean goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, fuga Diro nibara reari mujiineeda Yerusalemu neagwayi, ‘Aha! Mujiineeda Yerusalemu ghayi sik buuneeda sean silas uhuuda, ak ghwanung'waneasa gheata nea sidatas baruureagaaschi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula, aniini geawooschi haweewaneey, ea Diro gaydeaneey eemoojiga saang'a ng'ucheewana gawuurji laweajajeega basooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa gaygwanyarja ghamarda Diro nea gwanyarja mujiinajeagaaschi. Ak gaydeabuus birjeandaanyi nea ghaanung' ghoah lagheaneeda manda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak niny gayghoah heechea eepargeaniisa gheareedanga fuga lealu ghweayeega aba jeeda basooda, aba gideaba aniini neargu ng'asheanji, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ak niny gayghoah easanga eemoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haweagaaschi mida jeeda madameega gajeabwara ng'uta, ak saawa gayghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula, gaydeadu Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli was sugoocheanda sugoodiga. Gaydeadu badayda Diro nea gwaleabu wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ea faraasajeega, ea mutukwajeega ng'ucheeda, ea gea mida ding'da faraasajeega, ea lugooda, ea fuga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghabwar haweagaagu aba ng'uta aba jeeda madameega, ak gaygwasin museasooda aba headaang'u, nea ghwajap hilooga aba headaang'u, nea gagatkat igeambooda aba headaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwayiin dabitaanyi jea gwanyarjeawi haleanjeeda madeeda ghamardaang'u ak gaygafuta ng'eanyi aba joommajeagaaschi, nea gafta ng'eanyi madalajeagaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba seang'ayda faraasajeagaagu, gaygwadukutaneey birjeanda nyaawa. Ak gaygwaduumduum ghamarjoojigaagu aba ghuuta fuga ding'da faraasajeega ea geeshanga nyaawa, ea gea mutukwajeega ng'ucheeda, damanda hina gidaghuuta dooshtaang'u, gawuurji gidabeada buuneeda jeeda mujiineeda mida heeda sinyarja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gayghoala aba budilga faraasajeagaaschi naweadingaagu sean aba budilga ak gayghabwar fugaagu aba ng'uta nea daranajeagaagu majeekcheewi gajeenyarja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak meanang'oocheanduumeadaang'u gajeenung' ghoah easanga, nea haleanjeadaang'u geayaak shageata, ak saawa gaygwanyarja ghamarjoojigaagu, nea gwanyarja gealgaagu miyaas, ak lagheangaagu, ea geedigaagu, ea birjeandaang'u gayghwayiin jeeda beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' ghwasiinda ghuuta sarmoojigaagu nea eara ghuuta gidoondoorajeagaagu ea maygudu eebiikta eayiiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaydanung' huwa lagheaneeda manda gil, ak gaywoosa heeda jea eepargeaniisa gheareedanga fuga lealu ghweayeega, ak ea maygudeedeasnyi aba gideaba aniini NG'UTAMIIDA gil neargu ng'asheanji gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Diro ng'asheanji heapi? Ng'eanyoojiga ghuuta basooda maygwaduumduum aba giibeedeaydaang'u, inyas gwasawana fuga sisawan nea geenuuseada aba bugustaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda fuga hees sean bea basooda gayghwararang'aana hoorgajeega nyaawa bea gheambalmeeda nea ghafwakta hang'weaka nyaawa ea gea suulga, ak gayghang'ut giyoonda, ak gaygoobitbit nea gaboodani damanda sean nea ghahamng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeenyahuusheeweey, nea geeyeeshiineey,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, Inyas ghaanung' huwa mujiineeda was roonghooda nea gawuurji mujiineeda meabiiteena buuneeda nea ghaanung' ghapka beega sheagi jih bea basooda headaang'u nea gwadukutaneey beega saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydearareang'seey jeeda shoomanda una mideawana fuga mida hoowa, ghayi mida muunda ng'eanyiida. Ak gaydanung' abiidana hoowa bea eemeegean damanda manda muudeanooda, nea manda fuga jea goobiida damanda manda muudeanooda, nea maygwanda gheata aba jeeda fuga majeekcheewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' huwa gida was gharbeeda, nea maygut midana eara eegaseadayeey, nea maygudu eadaanyi earahay, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
